---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Portrait from "../assets/index/portrait.jpg";
---

<style>
  .content {
    padding-top: var(--spacing-l);

    display: flex;
    gap: var(--spacing-l);
  }

  section {
    padding-top: 0;
    flex-grow: 5;
  }

  .content > section > p {
    padding-top: var(--spacing-m);
  }

  .content > section > .firstParagraph {
    padding-top: 0;
  }

  .portraitHolder {
    flex-grow: 1;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .portrait {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: var(--border-radius-rounded);
  }
  figcaption {
    text-align: right;
    font-size: var(--text-size-xs);
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .content {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .portraitHolder {
      margin: 0 var(--spacing-l);
    }
  }
</style>

<BaseLayout>
  <h1>Samory's treasure box</h1>
  <div class="content">
    <section>
      <p class="firstParagraph">Hello, welcome to my personal archive!</p>
      <p>
        In 2013, in an effort to spend less time in front of screens, I decided
        to learn how to paint with watercolor. This led me down the path of
        learning many crafty hobbies, which I'm showcasing on this website!
      </p>
      <p>
        These days I'm mostly doing woodworking. I usually learn by myself
        following various online tutorials, at the <a
          href="https://www.berlin.de/vhs/kurse/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener">Volkshochschule in Berlin</a
        >, or with friends.
      </p>
      <p>
        My current project is making a <a
          href="https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fliesentisch"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener">Fliesentisch</a
        > in collaboration with a ceramicist friend. More on that soon :)
      </p>
    </section>
    <figure class="portraitHolder">
      <Image
        class="portrait"
        src={Portrait}
        alt="A picture of me. I'm sitting in front of one of my paintings and some shelves filled with books. I'm wearing a red striped polo shirt."
      />
      <figcaption>
        Photo by <a
          href="https://piotrwojsznis.com/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener">Piotr Wojsznis</a
        >
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
